{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Revanchist</strong> is a first person survival horror game that takes inspiration from many of the genre's beloved classics. Follow a cryptic numbers station in search of answers and fight for survival as you uncover secrets buried for millennia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Punishing Combat</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes fighting isn't the only way forward. Conserve limited resources by carefully slipping past enemies or take matters into your own hands and carve your way through with a variety of unique and satisfying weaponry. Just remember every choice has it's risks and prepare to live with the consequences of your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Strict Inventory Management</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources are limited but so is inventory space. Strategic inventory management is the key to making it out alive. Choose your loadout wisely and plan ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Exploration is Key</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way through\u00a0a variety of detailed environments and piece together the tragic history and enigmatic story of The Revanchist, Go off the beaten path and discover new ways forward as you push through horrors forgotten by time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640820?t=1743832685","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640820?t=1743832685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/824969f00202cfd05bc79bf8b3bd0cc65933dea1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743832685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/824969f00202cfd05bc79bf8b3bd0cc65933dea1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743832685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[]